<section class="life-hero">
  <p class="eyebrow">Life Archive</p>
  <h1>生活</h1>
  <p>摄影、模型、随笔和日常观察。之后每张卡都可以换成你的照片、作品图或者专题入口。</p>
</section>

<section class="life-marquee" aria-label="life sections">
  <div class="life-track">
    <% for (let round = 0; round < 2; round++) { %>
      <article class="life-card photo-card">
        <div class="life-art">
          <span class="shape circle"></span>
          <span class="shape bar"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="life-copy">
          <span>Photography</span>
          <h2>摄影</h2>
          <p>生活随拍、城市、校园、器材记录，或者单独整理成图文日志。</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="life-card model-card">
        <div class="life-art">
          <span class="shape block"></span>
          <span class="shape line"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="life-copy">
          <span>Model</span>
          <h2>模型</h2>
          <p>模型制作、涂装过程、成品照片、材料和工具记录。</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="life-card essay-card">
        <div class="life-art">
          <span class="shape disc"></span>
          <span class="shape rail"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="life-copy">
          <span>Notes</span>
          <h2>随笔</h2>
          <p>不属于课程、不属于项目，但你想长期保存的想法。</p>
        </div>
      </article>
    <% } %>
  </div>
</section>
